WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.767
-Welcome back to the show, everybody.

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:06.033
You know, not a lot of things are certain in this crazy world.

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:08.100
We scurry through life lickety-split

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.901
from one fleeting experience to another.

00:00:09.901 --> 00:00:13.634
Nothing seems sacred anymore. Nothing seems permanent.

00:00:13.634 --> 00:00:15.601
And that's why this week at "The Tonight Show,"

00:00:15.601 --> 00:00:17.934
we're saluting the one thing we know is still permanent --

00:00:17.934 --> 00:00:19.334
THE permanent.

00:00:19.334 --> 00:00:22.334
A.k.a. the permanent wave. A.k.a. the perm.

00:00:22.334 --> 00:00:26.167
That's right. It's the return of "Tonight Show Perm Week."

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:27.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:27.534 --> 00:00:30.901
♪ It's Perm Week ♪

00:00:30.901 --> 00:00:33.834
♪ On the Fallon show ♪

00:00:33.834 --> 00:00:37.434
♪ It's Perm Week ♪

00:00:37.434 --> 00:00:42.133
♪ Oh, my God ♪

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:46.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:46.634 --> 00:00:48.901
-This is "Tonight Show Perm Week,"

00:00:48.901 --> 00:00:52.200
the very special week... [ Laughter ]

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.567
...where every day we pick someone

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:57.267
from our audience and stylishly perm their hair.

00:00:57.267 --> 00:01:01.067
Tonight's lucky perm recipient is Tyler Toledo.

00:01:01.067 --> 00:01:02.901
Oh, wow.

00:01:02.901 --> 00:01:07.200
Tyler is 22 years old. He's from Whitestone, New York.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.200
And he's very excited about his new hairdo.

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:12.067
It's been a big day for Tyler. Take a look.

00:01:12.067 --> 00:01:14.868
-Hi. I'm Tyler Toledo. And today I'm getting a perm.

00:01:14.868 --> 00:01:17.300
I have never thought about getting a perm before.

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.400
I've always just kind of been the type to just like,

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:21.400
"Ah, let it grow, see what happens."

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:22.901
I'm a little nervous to get a perm,

00:01:22.901 --> 00:01:24.868
but I'm very open to change in my life right now.

00:01:24.868 --> 00:01:27.067
-I'm Tyler's dad. -And we're Tyler's friends,

00:01:27.067 --> 00:01:29.367
and we can't wait to see what he looks like with a perm.

00:01:29.367 --> 00:01:30.801
-I wouldn't change Tyler's hair,

00:01:30.801 --> 00:01:32.834
but I support him on his journey.

00:01:32.834 --> 00:01:34.567
The only other person that I know that has a perm

00:01:34.567 --> 00:01:36.868
is my mother, and I look at the pictures, and I wonder why.

00:01:36.868 --> 00:01:38.801
-My grandmother had a perm in the '70s,

00:01:38.801 --> 00:01:40.567
and you look at all those old pictures

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:42.968
and she absolutely killed it. -And now Tyler's getting a perm,

00:01:42.968 --> 00:01:44.701
and I'm also wondering why.

00:01:44.701 --> 00:01:47.567
-I'm hoping Tyler doesn't look like Hagrid from "Harry Potter."

00:01:47.567 --> 00:01:50.167
He's got the beard, too, so it's likely.

00:01:50.167 --> 00:01:51.901
-I don't think the world is ready

00:01:51.901 --> 00:01:54.834
for what they're about to see -- a whole different Tyler.

00:01:54.834 --> 00:01:56.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:56.234 --> 00:01:57.834
-Yeah. Yeah. A whole different Tyler.

00:01:57.834 --> 00:02:03.100
Now, Tyler has been sequestered since he got permed,

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:05.234
so he hasn't seen himself yet.

00:02:05.234 --> 00:02:08.400
And his dad and his friends haven't seen him, either.

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:11.868
This entire process has been cloaked in secrecy.

00:02:11.868 --> 00:02:14.234
We've got his dad and his friends right here.

00:02:14.234 --> 00:02:15.968
Hello, guys. How you guys doing?

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:17.200
Nice to see you.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:18.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:18.567 --> 00:02:19.934
Nice to see you.

00:02:19.934 --> 00:02:22.534
Dad, you couldn't perm your hair if you tried.

00:02:22.534 --> 00:02:24.100
-No, no, no. Not at all, Jimmy.

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:25.734
-You've got short, short, short hair.

00:02:25.734 --> 00:02:28.367
And you had a great Hagrid line. That was pretty funny.

00:02:28.367 --> 00:02:29.934
-Thank you. -Yeah, you're welcome.

00:02:29.934 --> 00:02:31.767
Alright, now, do not remove the blindfolds

00:02:31.767 --> 00:02:33.334
until I tell you, okay?

00:02:33.334 --> 00:02:34.801
Are you excited? -Very excited.

00:02:34.801 --> 00:02:36.267
-Yes. Yeah. -Alright. Very good.

00:02:36.267 --> 00:02:38.334
Audience, are you ready? Are you ready...

00:02:38.334 --> 00:02:39.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:39.501 --> 00:02:44.234
...for the brand-new freshly permed Tyler?

00:02:44.234 --> 00:02:46.834
Here is Tyler before.

00:02:46.834 --> 00:02:49.501
And here he is now. Tyler, come on out!

00:02:49.501 --> 00:02:50.567
[ Drum roll ]

00:02:50.567 --> 00:02:51.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:51.934 --> 00:02:56.934
-♪ Oh, my God ♪

00:02:56.934 --> 00:02:59.834
-Can you do a 360? -That's great.

00:02:59.834 --> 00:03:01.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:04.200
-Stand right on the star. -I'm so excited.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.367
-Wow.

00:03:06.367 --> 00:03:09.100
[ Applause ]

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:12.701
Wow! Tyler, you look great.

00:03:12.701 --> 00:03:14.267
Do you feel great?

00:03:14.267 --> 00:03:16.901
-I feel incredible. -Wow.

00:03:16.901 --> 00:03:20.934
Uh, guys, are you ready to see Tyler?

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:22.067
-Yes. -Yeah.

00:03:22.067 --> 00:03:23.734
-Hold hands. Hold hands and follow me.

00:03:23.734 --> 00:03:26.000
-Alright. [ Laughter ]

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.667
-We're getting closer and closer.

00:03:27.667 --> 00:03:29.067
Do not take off your blindfolds yet.

00:03:29.067 --> 00:03:32.767
Alright. Who are you most excited to see your new look?

00:03:32.767 --> 00:03:34.133
Dad?

00:03:34.133 --> 00:03:36.200
-He's -- He's seen every single one of my hairdos.

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:38.167
This is gonna be a unique one.

00:03:38.167 --> 00:03:39.868
-This will be a --

00:03:39.868 --> 00:03:41.467
-One he's never seen before.

00:03:41.467 --> 00:03:42.901
-Proud papa/son moment.

00:03:42.901 --> 00:03:46.767
Alright. Whenever you guys are ready, take off your blindfolds.

00:03:46.767 --> 00:03:47.901
-Ohh!

00:03:47.901 --> 00:03:53.534
-♪ Oh, my God ♪

00:03:53.534 --> 00:03:55.868
-I like it. I like it.

00:03:55.868 --> 00:03:57.267
-I like it.

00:03:57.267 --> 00:03:58.868
-You're like twins almost.

00:03:58.868 --> 00:04:00.734
-No, we don't look like twins.

00:04:00.734 --> 00:04:02.934
Much better-looking.

00:04:02.934 --> 00:04:07.033
Now for the most important reveal of all.

00:04:07.033 --> 00:04:09.100
Tyler, are you ready to see yourself?

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:10.968
-I'm about as ready as I can be. -You ready for this?

00:04:10.968 --> 00:04:14.033
-Ready. -Three, two, one.

00:04:14.033 --> 00:04:15.868
Have a look.

00:04:15.868 --> 00:04:20.100
-♪ Oh, my God ♪

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:22.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:22.534 --> 00:04:24.934
[ Applause ]

00:04:30.033 --> 00:04:31.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:31.434 --> 00:04:32.868
-I like it. -I like it, too.

00:04:32.868 --> 00:04:34.634
-It's a good look.

00:04:34.634 --> 00:04:36.133
It's a good -- You got a good face.

00:04:36.133 --> 00:04:37.434
It's a good look.

00:04:37.434 --> 00:04:40.300
Our thanks to the Randy Darden Hair Salon

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:41.801
for this wonderful perm.

00:04:41.801 --> 00:04:43.767
We're giving out perms every night this week.

00:04:43.767 --> 00:04:45.901
Happy Perm Week, everybody.

00:04:45.901 --> 00:04:48.033
We'll be right back with Liam Neeson.

00:04:48.033 --> 00:04:50.167
Come on back.

00:04:50.167 --> 00:04:54.968
♪ It's Perm Week on the Fallon show ♪

